<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Controlling High Blood Pressure — F/U-BP Workflow</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#173049;
    --blue:#1F6FB2;
    --teal:#0F8A6A;
    --pulse:#E0533B;
    --paper:#FFFFFF;
    --tint:#F2F7F7;
    --card:#E9F3F0;
    --card2:#EAF1F8;
    --line:#D7E2E5;
    --muted:#5C7184;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;}
  body{
    font-family:'Figtree',-apple-system,sans-serif;
    color:var(--ink);
    background:var(--tint);
    line-height:1.55;
    -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;
    print-color-adjust:exact;
  }
  .page{
    max-width:820px;
    margin:0 auto;
    background:var(--paper);
    padding:38px 46px 26px;
  }

  /* Header */
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:.16em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--blue);
    margin:0 0 6px;
  }
  h1{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:34px;
    line-height:1.08;
    margin:0 0 6px;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .lede{
    font-size:16px;
    color:var(--muted);
    margin:0 0 14px;
    max-width:60ch;
  }
  .pulse{display:block;width:100%;height:54px;margin:2px 0 22px;}

  h2{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:21px;
    margin:0 0 12px;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .section{margin:0 0 22px;}

  /* Story / charts */
  .charts{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr;
    gap:18px;
  }
  .panel{
    background:var(--tint);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:16px 18px 14px;
  }
  .panel .plabel{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:10.5px;
    letter-spacing:.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--muted);
    margin:0 0 12px;
  }
  .bars{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:16px;height:118px;}
  .bar{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;height:100%;}
  .bar .col{width:100%;max-width:54px;border-radius:7px 7px 0 0;position:relative;}
  .bar .val{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-weight:500;
    font-size:14px;
    margin-bottom:6px;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .bar .cap{
    font-size:11px;
    color:var(--muted);
    margin-top:7px;
    text-align:center;
    line-height:1.25;
  }
  .delta{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--teal);
    margin:12px 0 0;
    font-weight:500;
  }
  .story-line{
    grid-column:1 / -1;
    font-size:15px;
    color:var(--ink);
    margin:4px 2px 0;
  }
  .story-line strong{color:var(--teal);font-weight:600;}

  /* Reminder callout */
  .reminder{
    background:var(--ink);
    color:#fff;
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:22px 26px;
    display:flex;
    gap:18px;
    align-items:flex-start;
  }
  .reminder .mark{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;
    font-size:30px;
    line-height:1;
    color:#FFD9CF;
    flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .reminder h3{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:19px;
    margin:0 0 6px;
    color:#fff;
  }
  .reminder p{margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#D6E2EA;}
  .reminder p strong{color:#fff;font-weight:600;}

  /* Code box */
  .codebox{
    margin-top:14px;
    background:var(--card2);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:12px;
    padding:14px 18px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:16px;
  }
  .codebox .tag{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-weight:500;
    font-size:18px;
    color:var(--blue);
    background:#fff;
    border:1px solid #C5DBEF;
    border-radius:8px;
    padding:8px 14px;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .codebox .txt{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink);}
  .codebox .txt b{font-weight:600;}

  /* Stats */
  .stats{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
    gap:12px;
  }
  .stat{
    background:var(--card);
    border-radius:13px;
    padding:15px 14px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .stat .big{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:27px;
    color:var(--teal);
    line-height:1;
    margin:0 0 6px;
  }
  .stat.warn .big{color:var(--pulse);}
  .stat .sm{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.35;}
  .why-line{
    font-size:15px;
    color:var(--ink);
    margin:14px 2px 0;
    max-width:70ch;
  }
  .why-line strong{font-weight:600;}

  /* Footer */
  .foot{
    margin-top:26px;
    padding-top:14px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:baseline;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:8px;
  }
  .foot .q{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);}
  .foot .src{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:10.5px;
    color:var(--muted);
    letter-spacing:.03em;
  }

  @media print{
    body{background:#fff;}
    .page{padding:24px 30px;max-width:none;}
    @page{margin:0.5in;}
  }
  @media (max-width:620px){
    .charts{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
    .reminder{flex-direction:column;gap:8px;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <p class="eyebrow">F/U-BP Workflow Update</p>
  <h1>Controlling High Blood Pressure</h1>
  <p class="lede">Good news worth sharing: the F/U-BP workflow is catching on across the team, and the patients we are coding are getting to goal at a higher rate. The trend is heading the right way.</p>

  <svg class="pulse" viewBox="0 0 820 54" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <line x1="0" y1="38" x2="820" y2="38" stroke="#D7E2E5" stroke-width="1"/>
    <polyline points="0,38 180,38 205,38 216,16 228,52 240,24 252,38 320,38 380,34 450,28 540,21 640,15 740,10 820,8"
      fill="none" stroke="#E0533B" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    <circle cx="820" cy="8" r="4.5" fill="#E0533B"/>
  </svg>

  <!-- THE STORY -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2>The story so far</h2>
    <div class="charts">

      <div class="panel">
        <p class="plabel">F/U-BP adoption · encounters</p>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar">
            <div class="val">1.5%</div>
            <div class="col" style="height:11%;background:#9DBBD3;"></div>
            <div class="cap">April</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bar">
            <div class="val">12.1%</div>
            <div class="col" style="height:88%;background:#1F6FB2;"></div>
            <div class="cap">May</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="delta">▲ roughly 8x in one month</p>
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <p class="plabel">Controlled BP · coded patients</p>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar">
            <div class="val">20.4%</div>
            <div class="col" style="height:68%;background:#8FCBB8;"></div>
            <div class="cap">Baseline</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bar">
            <div class="val">23.6%</div>
            <div class="col" style="height:79%;background:#3FA987;"></div>
            <div class="cap">Through Apr</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bar">
            <div class="val">25.9%</div>
            <div class="col" style="height:87%;background:#0F8A6A;"></div>
            <div class="cap">Through May</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="delta">▲ up 5.5 points from baseline</p>
      </div>

      <p class="story-line">More of us using the workflow, more patients reaching control. <strong>That is exactly the connection we are hoping to see.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- THE REMINDER -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="reminder">
      <div class="mark">♥</div>
      <div>
        <h3>One small habit keeps this moving</h3>
        <p>Any time a patient's blood pressure is <strong>above 140/90</strong> ensure <strong>F/U-BP</strong> is included in the reason for visit for the next appointment. That single step is what lets the measure capture the follow up, and it is what is driving the numbers above.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="codebox">
      <span class="tag">F/U-BP</span>
      <span class="txt"><b>Follow up, blood pressure</b> &nbsp;·&nbsp; add it as a reason for visit whenever BP is above 140/90.</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- WHY IT MATTERS -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2>Why our effort matters</h2>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat">
        <p class="big">~48%</p>
        <p class="sm">of US adults have high blood pressure</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat warn">
        <p class="big">1 in 5</p>
        <p class="sm">have it under control nationally</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat warn">
        <p class="big">~75%</p>
        <p class="sm">of cardiovascular deaths involve it</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <p class="big">"Silent"</p>
        <p class="sm">most patients feel completely fine</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="why-line">High blood pressure rarely announces itself, which is why a controlled reading at the right visit is such a quiet win. <strong>Every patient we help get to goal is a real reduction in their risk of heart attack and stroke.</strong> Small documentation habits, repeated across the panel, add up to better outcomes for the people we serve.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="foot">
    <span class="q">Questions? Contact Jo or Vicki.</span>
    <span class="src">National figures: CDC / NCHS, 2021–2023</span>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
